[h1]Hi, everyone! Thank you so much for playing our game! It really means a lot to us. Also, thank you for helping others in the discussion. [/h1]

Here is our first patch that fixes the most annoying bugs (and a couple of minor ones as well)
Achievement "Dust off the past" is unlocked now. We saw, how many people were frustrated over it, so we made it our priority;

[olist]
[*] You can't get stuck in a photo album anymore; 
[*] The soft lock with the mug is fixed; 
[*] Rotation for objects in the pink casket is fixed;
[*] Blocking volumes are set everywhere, so players cannot lose things under the bed, table, etc.;
[*] Magazines do not overlap with their storage anymore; 
[/olist]

In the next patch this week we will solve the problem with the flower sticker on the calendar and will also do some minor adjustments. 

We also remind you that if you always want to see hints on where to put items, you can enable it in the pause menu. 

That's it, folks! Join our Discord and add our game to your wishlist (pretty please?)
